{"ref":"BDB, מִטָּה","hw":"מִטָּה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִטָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. couch, bed (</strong><em>place of reclining;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מטותם</span> Ecclus <a data-ref=\"Ben Sira 48:6\" href=\"/Ben_Sira.48.6\">48:6</a><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִטָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:12\" href=\"/Amos.3.12\">Am 3:12</a> + 14 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִטַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.21\">2 K 4:21</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִטָּתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:7\" href=\"/Psalms.6.7\">ψ 6:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִטָּתֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:28\" href=\"/Exodus.7.28\">Ex 7:28</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִטָּתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.7\">2 S 4:7</a> + 6 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִטּוֹת</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.2\">2 K 11:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 22:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.22.11\">2 Ch 22:11</a>, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:4\" href=\"/Amos.6.4\">Am 6:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:6\" href=\"/Esther.1.6\">Est 1:6</a>;—<em>couch, bed</em>, common article of furniture <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.10\">2 K 4:10</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:32\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.32\">32</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.19\">1 K 17:19</a>, for repose, especially at night, or in illness <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:31\" href=\"/Genesis.47.31\">Gn 47:31</a> (J; <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹאשׁ הַמּ׳</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 48:2\" href=\"/Genesis.48.2\">48:2</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:33\" href=\"/Genesis.49.33\">49:33</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:7\" href=\"/Psalms.6.7\">ψ 6:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.14\">Pr 26:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.25\">2 Ch 24:25</a> (prob.), and for sitting, or reclining by day <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.23\">1 S 28:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.4\">1 K 21:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּאַת מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:12\" href=\"/Amos.3.12\">Am 3:12</a>; seat of King Solomon <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 3:7\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.3.7\">Ct 3:7</a>; in bed-chamber <span dir=\"rtl\">(חֲדַר מִשְׁכָּב)</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:28\" href=\"/Exodus.7.28\">Ex 7:28</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.7\">2 S 4:7</a>; sometimes portable <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.15\">1 S 19:15</a> cf. v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.16\">16</a>, hence = <em>bier</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:31\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.31\">2 S 3:31</a>; sometimes high <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:4\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.4\">2 K 1:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.16\">16</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">עָלָה שָׁם</span>, opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָרַד מִן</span>); sometimes costly, (with frames) of ivory <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:4\" href=\"/Amos.6.4\">Am 6:4</a>; for reclining at feasts, made of gold and silver <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:6\" href=\"/Esther.1.6\">Est 1:6</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, כְּבוּדָּ֯ה\" href=\"/BDB,_כְּבוּדָּ֯ה\", dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ כְּבוּדָּה</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:41\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.41\">Ez 23:41</a> <em>glorious couch;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲדַר הַמִּטּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.2\">2 K 11:2</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 22:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.22.11\">2 Ch 22:11</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָדַר\" href=\"/BDB,_חָדַר\", dir=\"rtl\">חֶדֶר</a>).—Cf. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, מִשְׁכָּב\" href=\"/BDB,_מִשְׁכָּב\", dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁכָּב</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(שׁכב)</span>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, עֶ֫רֶשׂ\" href=\"/BDB,_עֶ֫רֶשׂ\", dir=\"rtl\">עֶרֶשׂ</a>.","next":"BDB, מֻטָּה","prev":"BDB, מַטֶּה²"}